  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1100873.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Aquest dilluns ha comen&ccedil;at a Onda el primer torn de les tres escoletes d&#39;estiu que organitza l&#39;Ajuntament i gestiona l&#39;empresa M&oacute;n d&#39;Animaci&oacute;: la infantil (col&middot;legi Pius XII), la de cer&agrave;mica (Museu del Taulell &#39;Manolo Safont&#39;) i l&#39;esportiva (poliesportiu municipal, a la foto). Tamb&eacute; s&#39;han iniciat els campus de les escoles de futbol del CD Onda (La Serratella) i del CF Racing Onda (l&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic). Tot en 145 fotos</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiaescoletesestiucampusfutbol15/p1100784.jpg\" alt=\"p1100784\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiaescoletesestiucampusfutbol15/p1100785.jpg\" alt=\"p1100785\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiaescoletesestiucampusfutbol15/p1100786.jpg\" alt=\"p1100786\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiaescoletesestiucampusfutbol15/p1100787.jpg\" alt=\"p1100787\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiaescoletesestiucampusfutbol15/p1100788.jpg\" alt=\"p1100788\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiaescoletesestiucampusfutbol15/p1100789.jpg\" alt=\"p1100789\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiaescoletesestiucampusfutbol15/p1100791.jpg\" alt=\"p1100791\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4